---
/**
 * Replaces Starlight's page banner with a quiet, site-wide pointer to the Nebari Classic docs.
 * Only the www.nebari.dev build uses this override, so it appears on every page there.
 */
---

<div class="classic-banner" data-pagefind-ignore>
  Looking for Nebari Classic? Its docs have moved to <a href="https://classic.nebari.dev/welcome/">classic.nebari.dev</a>.
</div>

<style>
  .classic-banner {
    padding: 0.375rem var(--sl-nav-pad-x);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    background-color: var(--sl-color-bg-nav);
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-xs);
    text-align: center;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .classic-banner a {
    color: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
  }
</style>
